          "tokens": [
            3,
            4,
            5,
            6
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "May it never be! ",
          "tokens": [
            7,
            8
          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "But by their fall salvation has come to the Gentiles, ",
          "tokens": [
            9,
